# Ball Pit scripted session (300 ticks): every mechanic once, then ten fingers at once.
# a tap in empty space: three balls drop from the beam, playing a little rising tune
tap   15 0 300 150
# a tap on the pile: the balls around it hop into the air
tap   50 1 560 420
# one finger scoops through the pile, a second one comes back the other way
drag  70 60 0 150 430 800 400
drag  95 60 1 820 340 160 380
# a hold in empty space pours balls slowly
hold 130 70 2 700 120
# a finger circles over the heap
wave 150 70 3 480 380 130 1.5
# another quick tap in the air
tap  205 4 250 140
# ten fingers at once: random drags until the end
fuzz 215 85 10
